Using Sets for Graph Visited Tracking Sets are essential in graph algorithms for tracking visited nodes and preventing infinite loops in cyclic graphs. public List<Integer> bfs(Map<Integer, List<Integer>> graph, int start) {
    Set<Integer> visited = new HashSet<>();
    Queue<Integer> queue = new ArrayDeque<>();
    List<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();

